{"seq":3,"slug":"gamma-ray-bursts","title":"伽马射线暴","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/compact-objects/gamma-ray-bursts","wordCount":1537,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"伽马射线暴\">伽马射线暴</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>伽马射线暴（GRB）是宇宙中最剧烈的电磁爆发：在几秒到几分钟内，从一个点源释放出相当于太阳一生总辐射的能量，瞬时光度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>52</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{52}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">52</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> erg/s，几乎照亮可观测宇宙的边缘。它们由<a href=\"black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>或<a href=\"neutron-stars-pulsars\">中子星与脉冲星</a>的极端形成过程驱动——要么是大质量恒星核坍缩成黑洞，要么是双中子星并合。</p>\n<p>GRB 是本 hub 多条主线的交汇点。它的瞬时辐射与余辉是<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/synchrotron-inverse-compton\">同步辐射与逆康普顿</a>和<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>的极端应用；短暴与双中子星并合的关联使它成为<a href=\"../multi-messenger/gravitational-waves\">引力波探测</a>的电磁对应体；它也是超高能<a href=\"../multi-messenger/cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>和<a href=\"../multi-messenger/high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>的候选源。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[中央引擎] --&gt; B[长暴&lt;br/&gt;大质量恒星坍缩]&#10;  A --&gt; C[短暴&lt;br/&gt;双中子星并合]&#10;  B --&gt; D[相对论性喷流&lt;br/&gt;洛伦兹因子约100-1000]&#10;  C --&gt; D&#10;  D --&gt; E[内激波&lt;br/&gt;瞬时伽马辐射]&#10;  D --&gt; F[外激波撞击星际介质&lt;br/&gt;多波段余辉]&#10;  E --&gt; G[火球模型]&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  C --&gt; H[引力波 + 千新星]&#10;  D --&gt; I[粒子加速 -&gt; 中微子/宇宙线]\">flowchart TD\n  A[中央引擎] --&gt; B[长暴&lt;br/&gt;大质量恒星坍缩]\n  A --&gt; C[短暴&lt;br/&gt;双中子星并合]\n  B --&gt; D[相对论性喷流&lt;br/&gt;洛伦兹因子约100-1000]\n  C --&gt; D\n  D --&gt; E[内激波&lt;br/&gt;瞬时伽马辐射]\n  D --&gt; F[外激波撞击星际介质&lt;br/&gt;多波段余辉]\n  E --&gt; G[火球模型]\n  F --&gt; G\n  C --&gt; H[引力波 + 千新星]\n  D --&gt; I[粒子加速 -&gt; 中微子/宇宙线]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>持续时间</th>\n<th>起源</th>\n<th>多信使关联</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>长暴</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> s</td>\n<td>大质量恒星核坍缩</td>\n<td>超新星 Ic、超高能光子</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>短暴</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt;2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span></span></span> s</td>\n<td>双中子星/中子星-黑洞并合</td>\n<td>引力波、千新星</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"火球模型与相对论性喷流\">火球模型与相对论性喷流</h2><p>GRB 的标准理论是火球（fireball）模型。中央引擎在极短时间内释放巨大能量，形成一个不透明的辐射-物质火球，因辐射压急剧膨胀，物质被加速到极端相对论性，洛伦兹因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma\\sim100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span>。这个高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span></span></span></span></span> 至关重要：它通过相对论性束流与时间压缩，化解了所谓&quot;致密性疑难&quot;——若辐射区是静止的，如此高的伽马光子密度会因正负电子对产生而不透明，而高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span></span></span></span></span> 把光子退移到对产生阈值之下，让伽马光子得以逃逸。</p>\n<p>观测到的能量需用准直喷流来调和。若各向同性等效能量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msub><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>53</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\rm iso}\\sim10^{53}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">iso</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">53</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> erg，而喷流半张角仅几度，则真实能量被压低约两三个数量级，落入恒星级中央引擎可供给的范围。喷流的存在还预言余辉光变会有&quot;喷流断裂&quot;——当相对论性束流锥因减速而展宽到超过喷流张角时，光变曲线变陡，由此可测量喷流张角与真实能量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"瞬时辐射与多波段余辉\">瞬时辐射与多波段余辉</h2><p>瞬时辐射（prompt emission）的能量耗散机制仍有争议，主流是内激波模型：火球内部不同 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span></span></span></span></span> 的壳层相互追撞，激波加速电子并通过<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/synchrotron-inverse-compton\">同步辐射与逆康普顿</a>辐射伽马射线。瞬时谱常用经验的 Band 函数（两段幂律平滑拼接）描述，峰值能量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">E_{\\rm peak}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathrm mtight\">peak</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 多在数百 keV。</p>\n<p>爆发后，喷流冲入周围星际介质，驱动一道前向外激波，被<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>的扩散激波加速的电子辐射出从X射线、光学到射电的余辉，可持续数天到数月。余辉的同步谱由几个特征频率分段，其随时间的幂律演化（闭合关系）能反推爆发能量、外介质密度和电子谱指数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>余辉特征频率</th>\n<th>物理含义</th>\n<th>诊断价值</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>m</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu_m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>最小注入电子的同步频率</td>\n<td>标定电子能量分配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>c</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu_c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>冷却频率</td>\n<td>标定磁场与时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>ν</mi><mi>a</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\nu_a</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0637em;\">ν</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0637em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>自吸收频率</td>\n<td>标定外介质密度</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2019 年起，MAGIC 与 H.E.S.S. 在 GRB 余辉中探测到 TeV 量级光子，证实余辉中存在显著的逆康普顿成分（SSC），把火球理论推进到甚高能波段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"中央引擎与多信使图景\">中央引擎与多信使图景</h2><p>短暴与长暴指向两类截然不同的中央引擎，但都归结为新生的<a href=\"black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>系统（或短暂存活的超大质量中子星）通过超吸积驱动喷流。长暴与某些 Ic 型超新星成协，确证其源自大质量恒星核坍缩（坍缩星模型）；短暴则与年老星族环境关联，指向双致密星并合。</p>\n<p>2017 年 8 月 17 日，GW170817 双中子星并合事件在引力波信号后约 1.7 秒被费米与 INTEGRAL 探测到伴随短暴 GRB 170817A，这是人类首次同时捕获同一天体的引力波与电磁信号，一举确证了短暴的并合起源，并把<a href=\"../multi-messenger/gravitational-waves\">引力波探测</a>与电磁观测正式焊接成多信使天文学。GRB 还被列为超高能<a href=\"../multi-messenger/cosmic-rays\">宇宙线</a>与<a href=\"../multi-messenger/high-energy-neutrinos\">高能中微子</a>的候选源，尽管 IceCube 迄今未在已知 GRB 方向探测到显著中微子，给火球中的强子加速效率设下了上限。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分类边界与-伪装者\">分类边界与&quot;伪装者&quot;</h2><p>长暴/短暴的两秒分界并非铁律，而是统计上的双峰，边界附近存在大量难以归类的事件。近年发现的几类&quot;伪装者&quot;动摇了简单二分法：有的持续时间超过两秒、本应是长暴，却伴随千新星而非超新星，指向并合起源（如 GRB 211211A）；反之也有短时标却来自坍缩的案例。这提醒我们，真正区分中央引擎要靠多维证据——宿主星系环境、是否成协超新星或千新星、谱硬度与光变结构，而非单一的时长阈值。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>判据</th>\n<th>偏向长暴/坍缩</th>\n<th>偏向短暴/并合</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>成协现象</td>\n<td>Ic 型超新星</td>\n<td>千新星</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>宿主环境</td>\n<td>恒星形成活跃区</td>\n<td>年老星族、星系外缘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>谱硬度比</td>\n<td>较软</td>\n<td>较硬</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这种分类的精细化直接服务于多信使搜寻：只有正确识别并合型 GRB，才能高效地把它与<a href=\"../multi-messenger/gravitational-waves\">引力波探测</a>信号做时间-方向符合，这正是<a href=\"../facilities-coordination/joint-alerts\">多信使联合警报</a>网络需要的先验信息。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>GRB 是宇宙最剧烈的电磁爆发，由大质量恒星坍缩（长暴）或双中子星并合（短暴）驱动，瞬时光度可达 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>52</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{52}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">52</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> erg/s。</li>\n<li>火球模型用洛伦兹因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Γ</mi><mo>∼</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Gamma\\sim100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Γ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span>–<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 的相对论性喷流化解致密性疑难，喷流断裂使我们能测出真实能量。</li>\n<li>瞬时辐射来自内激波，多波段余辉来自外激波，二者均靠<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/particle-acceleration\">粒子加速机制</a>与<a href=\"../radiation-mechanisms/synchrotron-inverse-compton\">同步辐射与逆康普顿</a>，TeV 余辉证实了 SSC 成分。</li>\n<li>中央引擎都归结为超吸积的<a href=\"black-holes-accretion\">黑洞与吸积盘</a>系统，长暴成协超新星、短暴成协<a href=\"neutron-stars-pulsars\">中子星与脉冲星</a>并合。</li>\n<li>GW170817 + GRB 170817A 确证短暴并合起源，是<a href=\"../multi-messenger/gravitational-waves\">引力波探测</a>与电磁观测联手的多信使里程碑。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"伽马射线暴","id":"伽马射线暴"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"火球模型与相对论性喷流","id":"火球模型与相对论性喷流"},{"level":2,"text":"瞬时辐射与多波段余辉","id":"瞬时辐射与多波段余辉"},{"level":2,"text":"中央引擎与多信使图景","id":"中央引擎与多信使图景"},{"level":2,"text":"分类边界与\"伪装者\"","id":"分类边界与-伪装者"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"黑洞与吸积盘","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/compact-objects/black-holes-accretion"},"next":{"title":"引力波探测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/astronomy-cosmology/high-energy-astrophysics/multi-messenger/gravitational-waves"}}